text The girl I'd been waiting to meet for a long time was standing next to the school gates.
text She was continually standing on the tip of her toes, as if she were looking for someone amidst the crowd of students walking home from school.
text I come up close and stand next to her.
setvar strS[1001] = "CGMS42"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
setimg CGMS42.png
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
sound TZF.aac
text @[Misae]
text ...
text The girl's face goes right to left, then left to right again after a short pause, her eyes following the crowd.
setvar strS[1001] = "NONE"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
text I try waving my hand right in front of her when she happens to look my way, but she doesn't respond at all.
text ......
text ...Then finally.
text Her eyes open up in delight as she finds the person she'd been looking for.
text The girl rushes up to him.
text I follow after her.
