text I was waiting in front of the school gates for Sagara-san that day as well.
text It had become part of my everyday lifestyle.
text And every day, she's been strangling me and kicking me around.
text I wonder if she'll do that today, too.
text Even so, somehow I felt that all this wasn't all too bad, either.
sound U8L.aac
text @[Voice]
text Oh.
text A man sees me as I'm waiting and approaches me.
sound U8M.aac
