text But you're waiting for Sagara because you like her, right?
sound U8T.aac
text @[Shima]
text No... That's not really why.
sound U8U.aac
text @[Igarashi]
text Huh?
sound U8V.aac
text @[Shima]
text I'm someone Sagara-san helped long ago, and so I'm trying to repay her somehow.
sound U8W.aac
text @[Igarashi]
text Hm... So that's why you've been following her around?
sound U8X.aac
text @[Igarashi]
